{"4351280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Robot Survivors", "steam_appid": 4351280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL ISN'T ENOUGH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair  reactors, hack terminals, rescue astronauts - all while fighting through relentless robot hordes where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/c931f09256a6747608481158bb6b01b8.poster.avif?t=1787974254\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/c931f09256a6747608481158bb6b01b8.webm?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/c931f09256a6747608481158bb6b01b8.mp4?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Juggle objectives while surrounded by hundreds of enemies.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EACH RUN BUILDS TOWARD A FINAL SHOWDOWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten-minute runs with clear objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through escalating waves, defeat a mid-level boss, then push on to destroy the final boss and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/bd1e712a283cebfcc1749ccfc9f4ff51.poster.avif?t=1787974254\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/bd1e712a283cebfcc1749ccfc9f4ff51.webm?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/bd1e712a283cebfcc1749ccfc9f4ff51.mp4?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Face of against robot bosses</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO ROBOT POWER FANTASY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 70s Japanese super robots - bright, bold and toy-like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colourful alternative to the sea of dark fantasy survivor games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an unstoppable super robot unleashing awesome weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/23e01047bf42ba0d9790243e7c579f91.poster.avif?t=1787974254\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/23e01047bf42ba0d9790243e7c579f91.webm?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/23e01047bf42ba0d9790243e7c579f91.mp4?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <i>Flip the balance of power with a perfectly timed upgrade</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your robot - speedy Zorbot with Flame Gun, mighty Thraxor with Photon Cannon or powerhouse Borak with Death Ray</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across Tengoku Space Station, Moon Base Toshi and Planet Kessho</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with 20 weapons each with evolving upgrade paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades to speed, health, hacking, and loot collection carry over between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions and uncover the secrets of Tengoku Space Station to unlock new weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly inspired by classic 70s Japanese robot cartoons and the toy robots we grew up with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimised for Steam Deck. Perfect for quick 10-minute sessions on the go</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/8f4839a9b513f68d7f7b5a73dd96b22e.poster.avif?t=1787974254\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/8f4839a9b513f68d7f7b5a73dd96b22e.webm?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/8f4839a9b513f68d7f7b5a73dd96b22e.mp4?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Each robot has unqiue abilities to make each run different</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by two veteran developers behind <strong>TY the Tasmanian Tiger</strong>, <strong>Destroy All Humans 2</strong> and <strong>Halloween Harry / Alien Carnage</strong>. We've shipped the games you may have grown up with, and now we're making the robot game we always dreamed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist and help us bring the 70s super robot dream to life!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL ISN'T ENOUGH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair  reactors, hack terminals, rescue astronauts - all while fighting through relentless robot hordes where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/c931f09256a6747608481158bb6b01b8.poster.avif?t=1787974254\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/c931f09256a6747608481158bb6b01b8.webm?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/c931f09256a6747608481158bb6b01b8.mp4?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Juggle objectives while surrounded by hundreds of enemies.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EACH RUN BUILDS TOWARD A FINAL SHOWDOWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten-minute runs with clear objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through escalating waves, defeat a mid-level boss, then push on to destroy the final boss and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/bd1e712a283cebfcc1749ccfc9f4ff51.poster.avif?t=1787974254\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/bd1e712a283cebfcc1749ccfc9f4ff51.webm?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4351280/extras/bd1e712a283cebfcc1749ccfc9f4ff51.mp4?t=1787974254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Face of against robot bosses</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETRO ROBOT POWER FANTASY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 70s Japanese super robots - bright, bold and toy-like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colourful alternative to the sea of dark fantasy survivor games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an unstoppable super robot unleashing awesome weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa